12
00:00:40.683 --> 00:00:43.960
And I feel like that's a very universal thing,

13
00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:48.790
like everybody has, in your case, it's your dad in the show.

14
00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:53.180
And everybody has this figure, person, company,

15
00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:56.260
whatever it is, breathing down their neck,

16
00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:59.818
forcing them to be better or challenging them.

17
00:00:59.818 --> 00:01:02.410
And that's such a big part of the show,

18
00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:03.780
