19
00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:05.270
Tell us about it.

20
00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:08.120
What I loved about the show is that

21
00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:10.510
there are these two relentless forces,

22
00:01:10.510 --> 00:01:13.650 line:15%
and they kind of meet on either end of the seesaw.

23
00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:17.570 line:15%
Sam is a relentless optimist who believes that people

24
00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:19.530 line:15%
are good and that people are worth saving,

25
00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:21.440
and that people are worth fighting for.

26
00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:24.212
And her dad is a relentless pain in the butt,

27
00:01:24.212 --> 00:01:28.350
but he is part of that older force

28
00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:31.070
that I think so many of us, so many women,

29
00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.360
so many people who aren't in sort of,

30
00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:37.190
the most privileged class are used to clashing with.

31
00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:40.790
And is this man gonna make room for his daughter?

32
00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:43.190
Is she gonna be allowed to use her gifts?

33
00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:46.630
Is she gonna be allowed to step into a leadership position,

34
00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:49.690
