35
00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:51.970
Or is she constantly gonna have to fight?

36
00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:53.640
Because she's younger, because she's a woman,

37
00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:55.370
because, you know, she gets judged

38
00:01:55.370 --> 00:01:57.680
when she walks in a room in a way that he doesn't.

39
00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:01.650
And you pract-, like you did you get to see a human heart?

40
00:02:01.650 --> 00:02:04.009
Yeah.
Like a real one?

41
00:02:04.009 --> 00:02:07.630
So, I spent all my time prepping shadowing surgeons

42
00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:09.610
in Los Angeles, and I was-
Wow.

43
00:02:09.610 --> 00:02:11.988
Able to scrub into these open heart surgeries

44
00:02:11.988 --> 00:02:15.370
and be in the OR for, you know, 6, 7, 8 hours.

45
00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:17.781
Turns out I'm completely not queasy, win for me.

46
00:02:17.781 --> 00:02:20.280
A dream, and I'm in there, like,

47
00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:22.740
