48
00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:23.820
And how do not go to the leg?

49
00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:25.640
Because if I look under the ribcage here,

50
00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:28.070
what I see is, and the doctors were just like,

51
00:02:28.070 --> 00:02:30.040
why do you know this?

52
00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:34.210
And in one of them, I'm standing over this man

53
00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:36.420
