60
00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:56.427
And every time I think about him, I just cry.

61
00:02:56.427 --> 00:02:58.920
It changed my life.

62
00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:02.270
Switching gears a little bit, your podcast,

63
00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:04.530
